              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wazelula phezu komntwana kathathu, wabiza uJehova, wathi: “Jehova Nkulunkulu wami, vumela umphefumulo walo mntwana ubuyele kuye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.21",
