              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Eliya wayesemthatha umfana, wamehlisa ekamelweni, wamngenisa endlini, wamnikela kunina; uElija wasesithi: Khangela, indodana yakho iyaphila.",
